      "html": "<h2>Rich notes</h2><p>Write with <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underline</u> and <s>strike</s>.</p><p><span class=\"tc-blue\">Coloured</span> <span class=\"tc-green\">text</span> and <span class=\"hl-yellow\">highlights</span> too.</p><ul><li>Lists</li><li>Checklists and to-dos</li></ul>"
